    "t": "<p>Figuren visar en punkt på enhetscirkeln.</p><span class=\"fig bred\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"370\" height=\"310\" viewBox=\"0 0 370 310\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Enhetscirkel med vinkeln 120 grader\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"368\" height=\"308\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#e4e3e6\"/><line x1=\"45\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"155\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"330,155 319,150 319,160\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><line x1=\"175\" y1=\"285\" x2=\"175\" y2=\"35\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"175,35 170,46 180,46\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><circle cx=\"175\" cy=\"155\" r=\"105\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2B2527\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"175\" y1=\"155\" x2=\"122.5\" y2=\"64.1\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"122.5\" cy=\"64.1\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#2B2527\"/><path d=\"M 213.0 155.0 L 212.9 151.7 L 212.4 148.4 L 211.7 145.2 L 210.7 142.0 L 209.4 138.9 L 207.9 136.0 L 206.1 133.2 L 204.1 130.6 L 201.9 128.1 L 199.4 125.9 L 196.8 123.9 L 194.0 122.1 L 191.1 120.6 L 188.0 119.3 L 184.8 118.3 L 181.6 117.6 L 178.3 117.1 L 175.0 117.0 L 171.7 117.1 L 168.4 117.6 L 165.2 118.3 L 162.0 119.3 L 158.9 120.6 L 156.0 122.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"217\" y=\"87.26\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">120°</text><text x=\"217\" y=\"87.26\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\">120°</text><text x=\"337\" y=\"161\" font-size=\"14\" font-style=\"italic\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\">x</text><text x=\"164\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"14\" font-style=\"italic\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\">y</text></svg></span><p>Bestäm \\(\\cos 120^\\circ\\) och \\(\\sin 120^\\circ\\).</p>",
    "s": "<p>På enhetscirkeln är punktens \\(x\\)-koordinat \\(\\cos v\\) och \\(y\\)-koordinaten \\(\\sin v\\).</p><p>\\[\\cos 120^\\circ=- \\frac{1}{2},\\qquad \\sin 120^\\circ=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}.\\]</p>",
