    "t": "<p>Bestäm triangelns area.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"390\" height=\"270\" viewBox=\"0 0 390 270\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Triangel med markerade mått\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"388\" height=\"268\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#e4e3e6\"/><polygon points=\"70.0,220.0 316.8,220.0 139.9,70.0\" fill=\"#f8f4e9\" stroke=\"#745637\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"55\" y=\"238\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\">A</text><text x=\"323.8\" y=\"238\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\">B</text><text x=\"139.9\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\">C</text><text x=\"80.71\" y=\"130.51\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\">5,5 cm</text><text x=\"198.7\" y=\"235.1\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\">8,2 cm</text><path d=\"M 81.8 194.6 L 84.2 195.9 L 86.4 197.3 L 88.5 198.9 L 90.4 200.8 L 92.1 202.8 L 93.6 205.0 L 94.9 207.3 L 96.0 209.7 L 96.9 212.2 L 97.5 214.7 L 97.9 217.4 L 98.0 220.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#B63D38\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"108\" y=\"199.8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">65°</text><text x=\"108\" y=\"199.8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#8F302D\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\">65°</text></svg></span>",
    "s": "<p>Areasatsen ger</p><p>\\[T=\\frac{bc\\sin A}{2}=\\frac{5,5\\cdot8,2\\sin 65^\\circ}{2}\\approx 20,4\\text{ cm}^2.\\]</p>",
    "familj": "procE_tri_area_2",
    "miniräknare": true,
    "geogebra": false
