    "t": "<p>Figuren visar de fyra första stegen i ett mönster.</p><span class=\"fig\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400\" height=\"205\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 205\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Mönster med antal rutor som förändras geometriskt\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"398\" height=\"203\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#e4e3e6\"/><rect x=\"32\" y=\"55\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#e8f0fb\" stroke=\"#2D70B3\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\">Steg 1</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\">1 ruta</text><rect x=\"122\" y=\"55\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#e8f0fb\" stroke=\"#2D70B3\"/><rect x=\"136\" y=\"55\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#e8f0fb\" stroke=\"#2D70B3\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\">Steg 2</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\">2 rutor</text><rect x=\"212\" y=\"55\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#e8f0fb\" stroke=\"#2D70B3\"/><rect x=\"226\" y=\"55\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#e8f0fb\" stroke=\"#2D70B3\"/><rect x=\"240\" y=\"55\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#e8f0fb\" stroke=\"#2D70B3\"/><rect x=\"254\" y=\"55\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#e8f0fb\" stroke=\"#2D70B3\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\">Steg 3</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\">4 rutor</text><rect x=\"302\" y=\"55\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#e8f0fb\" stroke=\"#2D70B3\"/><rect x=\"316\" y=\"55\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#e8f0fb\" stroke=\"#2D70B3\"/><rect x=\"330\" y=\"55\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#e8f0fb\" stroke=\"#2D70B3\"/><rect x=\"344\" y=\"55\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#e8f0fb\" stroke=\"#2D70B3\"/><rect x=\"358\" y=\"55\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#e8f0fb\" stroke=\"#2D70B3\"/><rect x=\"372\" y=\"55\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#e8f0fb\" stroke=\"#2D70B3\"/><rect x=\"302\" y=\"69\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#e8f0fb\" stroke=\"#2D70B3\"/><rect x=\"316\" y=\"69\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#e8f0fb\" stroke=\"#2D70B3\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\">Steg 4</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono, monospace\">8 rutor</text></svg></span><p>a) Ange kvoten mellan antalet rutor i två på varandra följande steg.<br>b) Hur många rutor finns i steg 6?</p>",
    "s": "<p>Antalet rutor fördubblas, så kvoten är \\(k=2\\).</p><p>Steg 6 har \\(1\\cdot2^5=32\\) rutor.</p><p><strong>Svar:</strong> a) \\(2\\), b) \\(32\\) rutor.</p>",
